Funding-Acknowledgement = {Weidenbaum Center on the Economy, Government, and Public Policy through
   The American Social Survey (TASS)},
Funding-Text = {We thank the Weidenbaum Center on the Economy, Government, and Public
   Policy for providing support for this project through The American
   Social Survey (TASS). We thank Nick Anspach, Ted Enamorado, Hans
   Hassell, Jonathan Green, Christopher Lucas, Jacob Montgomery, Will
   Nomikos, Mike Olson, Keith Schnakenberg, Betsy Sinclair, and Carly Wayne
